From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 16:02:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] patch 04: LOOKUP_EXPIRED errorCode from ftth-jobs.js; app
 matches the code, prose kept as fallback

---
 .../flow/operator/data/api/dto/FtthV3Dtos.kt  |  2 ++
 .../repository/FtthConversionRepository.kt    | 12 ++++++++++-
 .../tools/ftth/FtthConversionViewModel.kt     |  5 ++---
